SUMMARY:🎤 Karaoke Night at The Tavern 🍻
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nLooking for an actually fun night ou
 t in Durham?\nThis is one of those spots where the whole place just clicks
 .\n\nHuge bar.\nPool tables.\nDarts.\nA full karaoke stage.\nAnd a crowd t
 hat’s there to have a good time — whether you’re singing\, cheering 
 people on\, or just hanging with friends over drinks.\n\nThe karaoke here 
 is genuinely awesome because people actually get into it. You’ll hear ev
 erything from pop punk and country to throwback rap\, emo classics\, rock 
 anthems\, and songs everyone ends up singing together by the end of the ni
 ght.\n\nNo pressure to perform.\nNo “serious singer” vibe.\nJust good 
 energy\, great people\, and one of the most entertaining nights you can ha
 ve in Durham.\n\nCome solo\, bring friends\, grab a drink\, play some pool
 \, put your name on the list\, or just enjoy the show. Either way\, you’
 ll probably leave with a sore voice and a few new friends. 🎶
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31684
 3244/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261004T193335Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T193335Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
