SUMMARY:🎃 Walk & Brew: Halloween Crawl 👻🍻
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nIt’s getting cooler out\, so Walk 
 & Brew is getting a Halloween edition!\n\nWe’ll meet at 6:30 PM at Bull 
 McCabe’s and make our way through downtown Durham\, checking out costume
 s\, grabbing drinks\, getting some walking in\, and stopping at a few fun 
 spots along the way.\n\n6:30 — Bull McCabe’s\nOur starting point. Grab
  a drink\, meet everybody\, and we’ll head out together.\n\n→ The Velv
 et Hippo\nGetting here relatively early before the rooftop gets packed. Fo
 od is available if you’re hungry.\n\n→ Queeny’s\nBasically next door
 \, so an easy second stop—and another chance to grab food.\n\n→ High D
 ive\nOne more stop as we make our way toward Five Points.\n\n≈ 9:30 — 
 Rubies on Five Points 💃🕺\nOur final destination for The Mallgoth Hor
 ror Picture Show\, their Halloween dance party. The party starts at 9 PM a
 nd there’s a $10 cover.\n\nCome in costume if you want\, but it’s defi
 nitely not required. You can drink\, not drink\, eat along the way\, leave
  whenever you want\, or stick around and dance with us at the end.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31674
 2293/
